# frozen_string_literal: true

# lib/social_icons.rb -- the icons the engine can draw for a link to
# somewhere else: the footer's "find me on", and the share block on a post.
#
# Here rather than in build_blog.rb because it has three readers, and until
# this file existed two of them kept their own copy. scripts/style.rb had
# the names written out again with a comment admitting it ("kept in step
# with SOCIAL_ICONS in build/build_blog.rb"), and doctor had no list at all
# -- so an icon name the engine did not know drew an empty space in the
# footer and nothing anywhere said why. A list kept in step by hand is a
# list that goes out of step.
